---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Shipping & Dispatch Policy | Reliable Industries" description="Global logistics, packaging standards, and international freight dispatch policies of Reliable Industries mechanical seals and systems.">
  <Header />

  <!-- Hero Header -->
  <section style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #001a3b 0%, #003B6D 100%); padding: 75px 0 85px; color: white; text-align: center;">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="kicker" style="color: #009fe3; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.85rem; letter-spacing: 1.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 12px;">GLOBAL LOGISTICS & DISPATCH</span>
      <h1 style="font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 3.5vw, 3rem); font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 15px;">Shipping & Delivery Policy</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; color: #cbd5e1; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto;">
        Ensuring secure packaging, rapid air & sea freight customs clearance, and zero-damage global delivery.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Content Section -->
  <section style="padding: 70px 0 90px; background: #ffffff;">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 900px;">
      <div style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #eef2f6; border-radius: 8px; padding: 40px; box-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.03); line-height: 1.8; color: #475569;">
        
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 800; color: #002b54; margin-bottom: 15px;">1. Worldwide Export Destinations</h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 25px;">
          Reliable Industries dispatches engineered mechanical seals, replacement seal faces, and auxiliary piping systems to over 50 countries across North America, Europe, the Middle East, Southeast Asia, and Africa.
        </p>

        <h2 style="font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 800; color: #002b54; margin-bottom: 15px;">2. Packaging & Shock Protection</h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 25px;">
          Mechanical seal silicon carbide and tungsten carbide faces are ultra-sensitive precision components. All products are vacuum-sealed with anti-corrosion VCI barrier wrap, encased in dense shock-absorbing polyurethane foam, and crated in heavy-duty export-certified fumigated ISPM-15 wooden boxes.
        </p>

        <h2 style="font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 800; color: #002b54; margin-bottom: 15px;">3. Emergency Turnaround Air Freight</h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 25px;">
          For critical plant breakdowns and emergency shutdowns, we provide expedited international express courier dispatch (via DHL, FedEx, or dedicated Air Cargo) with dispatch within 24 to 48 hours for standard units.
        </p>

        <h2 style="font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 800; color: #002b54; margin-bottom: 15px;">4. Tracking & Customs Documentation</h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 25px;">
          Complete export documentation—including Commercial Invoice, Certificate of Origin, Packing List, and airway bill/bill of lading tracking—is electronically provided immediately upon dispatch.
        </p>

        <div style="background: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid #009fe3; padding: 18px 22px; border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0; margin-top: 30px;">
          <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.92rem; color: #334155;">
            <strong>Need tracking for an active order?</strong> Contact our logistics desk at <a href="mailto:dispatch@reliableseal.com" style="color: #009fe3; font-weight: 600;">dispatch@reliableseal.com</a> or call <a href="tel:+917888065559" style="color: #009fe3; font-weight: 600;">+91- 78880 65559</a>.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
